<title>FRANCE: CYCLING-OUTSCHAKOV STRIPPED OF WIN IN FAVOUR OF DESBIENS.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-OUTSCHAKOV STRIPPED OF WIN IN FAVOUR OF DESBIENS.</headline>
<dateline>PERPIGNAN, France 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukrainian Sergei Outschakov was stripped of his win in the 11th stage of the Tour de France in favour of Frenchman Laurent Desbiens on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Desbiens finished just behind Outschakov in the sprint but the race judges ruled the Ukrainian had not kept his line.</p>
<p>Outschakov was placed third while Italian Carlo Finco was given second place.</p>
</text>
